OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court after 'explosive
OL,4,Asubstances' found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 70-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,7,Ffollowing an incident in which a 100m
OL,8,F(328ft) cordon was set up and police
OL,9,Ffound suspected explosive substances
OL,10,Fand firearms.
OL,12,FPeter Bissell, of Becket Road, Worle,
OL,13,Fhas been charged with possessing
OL,14,Fexplosive substances for unlawful
OL,15,Fpurposes and possessing a firearm
OL,16,Fwithout a certificate.
OL,18,FHe appeared at Bristol Magistrates'
OL,19,FCourt on Saturday and was remanded in
OL,20,Fcustody to appear at Bristol Crown
OL,21,FCourt next week.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
