OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court after 'explosive
OL,4,Asubstances' found
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvon and Somerset Police said the
OL,7,Fincident on 30 September had led to a
OL,8,F"complex and significant
OL,9,Finvestigation".
